{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_10_level_main_10-08_beg",
  "groupId": "main_10",
  "stageId": "main_10-08",
  "title": "他乡故知",
  "storyCode": "10-9",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "785af60e08cff507f6184c51a9d1688323daecfcf546d31dcc3b72d082dcd387",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g13_lightinduarea_indoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "7:17 P.M. 天气/阴\n伦蒂尼姆，萨迪恩区，废弃制醇厂"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走，快点走！不许站着不动，都给我干活去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "将军说了，这批材料必须在今天晚上弄完，然后送到车站去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哭什么？你想偷懒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊啊......别、别打我......我三四天没睡觉，实在是太累了......啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_400_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请住手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是什么人，敢挡住我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "海蒂女士......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_400_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别怕，站到我身后来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道了，你是那个前两天新来的。你是......老师？还是记者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了，记不清，反正就是维多利亚盛产的那种浪费粮食的废物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的花言巧语还是留给你们的贵族和富人吧，萨卡兹可不吃这套！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_400_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳......咳咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "出、出血了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_400_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你想就地处决我和我的同伴，那么请便吧。不过别忘了，这里还有一百多双眼睛在盯着你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......都看什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_400_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们在看你们准备怎么对付我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是一群俘虏而已，你以为我们会怕？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_400_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们当然不会。但工作不等人，不是吗？你说的，你们将军希望这批材料能在今天晚上加工完。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵，看到你们两个的下场，他们说不定还能更有力气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_400_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......要是猜到了明天早上等着他们的是什么，你觉得他们还愿意把最后的夜晚花在为敌人打造武器上吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......！你怎么知道明天......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_400_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还知道，你们有必须让我们活过今夜的理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，她在激你，你可别犯傻，把不该说的都抖出来。赶紧走吧，我们也有活要干。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别命令我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呦，也就是换了身衣服，脾气变这么大？你忘了是谁前阵子被几个维多利亚残兵打得一路喊妈妈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "滚吧，多嘴的雇佣兵。你的脑袋早晚会因为你的舌头而掉下来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这你得怪某个最近老在我耳边嚷嚷的家伙。相信我，我以前不是这么说话的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我忙得很，没工夫跟你们纠缠。行吧，就让这些人多活几个小时。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们......尤其是你，别想着耍花招。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_400_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都给我听好了，萨卡兹绝不养闲人，谁不乐意干活，谁就挨刀子，明白吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明白的话就都动起来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_400_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们暂时安全了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对、对不起，海蒂女士，我害您受了伤......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_400_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没事，只是弄脏了衣服而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您总是这么从容......只要与您待在一起，我就会觉得很安心......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_400_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就再相信我一回，好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_400_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "回屋子里去，和你的朋友们待在一起。萨卡兹还需要你们的巧手，他们暂且不会伤害你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_400_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至于这些雇佣兵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们最好也别看热闹了，今天晚上有的忙，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎哎没什么可是的，赫德雷不是叫我们听那些士兵的吗？是他叫我们动起来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别盯着这面墙了，这地方离出入口最远，连只虫子都飞不进来。瞧瞧这墙面——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——多结实啊。走吧走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g6_hideout"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "7:27 P.M. 天气/阴\n伦蒂尼姆，萨迪恩区，地下结构"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救军战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行进，行进！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救军战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "报告指挥官，三队已准备完毕！确认九号出入口安全——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救军战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "已确认，安全可通行！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "洛洛，你怎么来了？你的伤......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "队长，我请求归队。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是指挥官说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......比尔在他们手上。他是为了掩护我......我不能在他生死未卜的情况下，只顾自己躺着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我会救他回来。洛洛，我保证。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或许，在你们心里，我不是一个合格的队长......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是比尔在这里，他会说，你是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他一直相信你。我们......都相信你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "相信......我吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可这趟任务和我们过去那些暗地里的救援任务不一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们可能会正面撞上很多萨卡兹士兵，遇到前所未有的危险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "洛洛，在加入自救军之前，你才刚刚中学毕业，只是一名列车锅炉工的女儿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你也只是一个工匠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈......确实。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萨卡兹叫我们反抗军......可哪来的军队？我们就只是伦蒂尼姆的普通人而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你说的对，我是很普通。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我记不住指挥官说的大道理，不管什么时候，我心里想的都是让我的家人们活下来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "费斯特，我其实很怕萨卡兹......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我更怕你们会在我看不见的地方死去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道，洛洛......我也怕。我怕死，更怕我会害死你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说出来舒服多了，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们出发吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g7_subway"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我和因陀罗会与自救军一起守在这里，达格达与摩根已经去找阿米娅会合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你们很少分头行动。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "发生什么事了吗？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跟过去一样，还是什么都瞒不过你啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过也没什么，有些事情早晚得解决，只是需要一个恰当的时机而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "背负着所有人的期待前行，会很累。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "需要我和她们说什么吗？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛维希娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "各位，准备好了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛维希娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们刚刚抵达距离目标地点最近的出口。从这里到制醇厂，我们还需要穿过两个地下街区。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛维希娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们的两支小队已经就位，他们会确保大家一路畅通。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛维希娅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之后的指挥就交给你了，{@nickname}博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "克洛维希娅......她就做得很好。她和阿米娅，她们也都背负着所有人的期待。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，我想了一路，可能有些事我还没有完全想明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是唯独这件事，我必须自己处理。连最亲近的同伴都拉不住的话，我回到这里还有什么意义？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，费斯特发来信号，他们已经抵达地面，我们需要立刻与他们会合——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我们该出发了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "推进之王",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "嗯，我们会时刻准备接应。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "不知道伦蒂尼姆的空气怎么样。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "推进之王",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "哈哈......我也很想知道。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推进之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祝你们......一路畅通。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g10_lightinduarea_street_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "7:55 P.M. 天气/阴\n伦蒂尼姆，萨迪恩区，废弃制醇厂东侧入口外"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "布莱克，汇报前面的情况。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前路畅通，汇报完毕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罗本呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗本",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "狙击小队已就位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。敌人数量？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗本",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在我视野内的有十二个。都是萨卡兹士兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敌人指挥官位置？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗本",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不确定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "继续警戒，等我信号。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g13_lightinduarea_indoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "8:09 P.M. 天气/阴\n伦蒂尼姆，萨迪恩区，废弃制醇厂"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "痛苦的男声",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊——啊啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "痛苦的男声",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈......哈哈......啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_400_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......本尼，那边的房间关的是谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是......下午被送进来的自救军战士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_400_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他在遭受审讯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萨卡兹不会放过自救军的任何一点消息。这位战士他......他恐怕活不成了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_400_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望他能再坚持一下，也许用不了多久......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "21_G1_interrogat_room"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......他们来了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还没有动静。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那继续盯着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赫德雷的排查结果呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雇佣兵们还在各个厂房盯着我们的俘虏。他们忙活了大半天，但我们抓来的人不少，要一个个查很花时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再加上里面这个人也是硬骨头，怎么问都不肯开口......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。让他抓紧最后的时间。假如他仍然一无所获......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救军战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就又该轮到我登场了，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃啊——你、你——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——收起你的刀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "将军！这个人他怎么会！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你先去外面守着。这里我来处理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好......将军，你小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救军战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道的吧？就算你让他这一刀砍下来，我们也不会受伤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阁下......请不要让我的战士受到更多惊吓了，他们的弦已经绷得够紧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救军战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_403_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧好吧，我们只是不想迟到。毕竟你听，里面那位没什么声息了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那么，阁下来得正及时。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g8_jail"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......厂房南区是谁在负责？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "队长，是施瓦布带的小队。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "施瓦布......他五年前就在我队里干过活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "难道说......这就是你要我注意脚下影子的意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......确定施瓦布的位置。不，立刻叫他来见我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g13_lightinduarea_indoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_400_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本尼，厂房周围是不是有些安静？原本守在这里的雇佣兵，他们都走了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，一个都没留下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_400_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雇佣兵的表现......有些古怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们本来就很古怪，不是吗？萨卡兹想和谁做朋友，又想杀了谁，从来不讲道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_400_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......别这样说话，除非你有意激怒他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，海蒂女士......被关在这里半个多月，我很难不恨萨卡兹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_400_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没人会怪你。你做的已经够好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了女士，还有消息说，除了今天中午就过来了的雇佣兵首领，那个萨卡兹将军也在这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_400_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......曼弗雷德？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_400_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "连他都......糟了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_400_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是个陷阱。克洛维希娅......或许还有他们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你担心指挥官会在今天行动？我们得想个办法通知他们......呃......但这么多天了，我们找不到机会把消息传出这面墙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_400_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_400_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，他们一定也想过这会是陷阱。说不定......这同时是个机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_400_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本尼，通知其他人，我们的行动可能也要提前了。所有能战斗的人，做好战斗准备。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伦蒂尼姆市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，就算我们能离开厂房，也很难冲破大门外的重重防守......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_400_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那就到这里来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_400_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我记得，有一位雇佣兵告诉我，这面墙非常......安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g10_lightinduarea_street_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "8:45 P.M. 天气/阴\n伦蒂尼姆，萨迪恩区，废弃制醇厂南墙外"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "高一点......再飞高一点......这个位置很不错，嗯......视野稳定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可露希尔，你看到什么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......有三个入口，每处入口都有超过三十人把守。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在东侧入口守着的是萨卡兹，西南门也是萨卡兹......呃，但衣服不一样，看起来是雇佣兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有北边的正门......负责北门守卫的是......深池。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "另外园区里还有至少五六支巡逻队伍，在各个厂房之间来回走动......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦，等等......南边，就离我们最近的这面墙，这地方是空的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "空的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "按照布防情况，本来也该有一支队伍在这里巡逻......但他们好像消失了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "这可能是陷阱。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "也许我们有帮手。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，我们是否按照原计划行动？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "阿米娅，你觉得呢？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我们必须救出海蒂女士。而且，我们得尽快去中央区......嗯......无论如何，我们都不能耽搁了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "自救军呢？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救军战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "指挥官说的，这次行动听你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们也有要救的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，虽然我很想说，不管你怎么选，我们都会行动......但三队的兄弟说得对，你是总指挥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "好，计划不变。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "摩根小队，去东侧入口。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "摩根",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "好的，博士。达格达，我们走。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "自救军三队分头骚扰北门与西南门。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "自救军战士",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "收到。行动！"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "可露希尔继续负责侦察和支援。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希尔",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "没问题，交给我吧。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "阿米娅，给其他人发信号。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其他人？罗德岛还有人在地面上吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，费斯特先生。等他们收到信号，他们会知道今晚我们在这里有行动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您能看到他们的位置吗，博士？应该还不能吧？距离还不够近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不是说他们不在附近？呃，博士难道有什么特别的源石技艺？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "不是，是PRTS在帮我。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "费斯特",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "什么......什么神奇的技术？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "费斯特",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "博士，等回去以后，你可一定要好好跟我说一说。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "是的，我能透视。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "费斯特",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "博士，你不是在骗我吧？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "费斯特",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "你一定是带着什么特殊终端，带显示屏的那种！"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然有人会来，我们要在外面等吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用，如果他们判断有必要与我们会合，那也是在我们进去之后。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我们还是得解决怎么进去的问题......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，你说吧，走哪边？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我们就走南边。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是墙......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可露希尔，费斯特先生，你们有没有办法让我们翻过那面墙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要不要试试看炸掉？我们新做了一批爆破装置，要炸倒伦蒂尼姆的外墙是不可能的，但这个的话说不定......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......有点难。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伦蒂尼姆的厂房外墙都做过一定的防爆处理，除非能从内部引爆，否则的话，很可能炸不出理想效果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那......加大力度？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不行，太引人注目了。这会让摩根他们的努力白费。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是哦......还不如让摩根带一点走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "用滑索吧。我和洛洛在躲避巡逻队的时候偶尔会用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "强尼，把装备拿过来——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救军战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行啊队长，你真没让我白背。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有备无患嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我需要洛克五号来定位......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了，差点忘了给你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个是......洛克十七？怎么会在你手上......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为从地底爬出来的路上我还在加班加点啊！你看你看，都调整完了。我保证，它很稳定！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，不知道对你来说我的保证有没有用......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳，我看过了，很稳定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个小耳朵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我顺手加上去的，可露希尔牌无人机都有哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "完了，你是不是不太喜欢？要是不喜欢的话......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不用改回去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那无人机没问题了吧？我带博士，强尼和加比自己走。洛洛......你可以带阿米娅吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我发射牵引装置了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "洛克十七，瞄准！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "成功附着！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "洛洛小姐，拜托你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，请抓紧我。这面墙不算高，但弹射的力量可能还是不小。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "果然还是逃不过吗？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我什么时候才能自己把握命运？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......都准备好了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "各位，我们的机会可能只有一次——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三、二、一——发射！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
